# Reference repo (cloned from the internet — not part of CourseRAG)
/mcp-local-rag/

# Runtime data root (default from config). Holds each course's index, its downloaded
# models, and — under courses/<id>/raw/ — the source PDFs themselves, which are
# copyrighted course material and are never committed. The eval sets (evals/) record
# which files and pages they label, so the baseline stays reproducible without
# shipping the documents.
/course-kb/

